### 📊 Comparison: Hash Properties Summary Table

| Property | What it prevents | Security Level | Difficulty |
|----------|-----------------|-----------------|------------|
| Pre-image Resistance | Reversing hash | 🔴 **CRITICAL** | 2^n |
| Second Pre-image Resistance | Message forgery | 🔴 **CRITICAL** | 2^n |
| Collision Resistance | Finding any two equal hashes | 🔴 **HARDEST** | 2^(n/2) |
| Avalanche Effect | Predictability | 🟡 Important | Varies |
| Fixed Output | Length extension attacks | 🟢 Basic | N/A |

